    "Project A": {
      "Clarity of Value Proposition": "• Relatively clear – the combination of a physical book and app offers a novel approach to children's learning and storytelling. However, the ‘supporting pediatric care’ aspect feels somewhat tacked on and lacks strong connection to the core value.",
